["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"David Vélez - Building Nubank and the Future of Global Banking - [Invest Like the Best, EP.495] foundation model open banking / open finance stablecoin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-13-ilt-chatgpt能重写你的产品-却拿不到银行牌照/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2e1d3d395b96b48a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>ChatGPT能重写你的产品，却拿不到银行牌照</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Nubank创始人认为，这正是为什么规模玩家反而最吃到AI红利——他们已经攒下十几年数据、拿到了牌照，AI只是放大优势的杠杆，而非抹平优势的推土机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融科技</span><span class=\"tag\">AI应用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Why does everything get a standing ovation now? triumph groundlings big lady theory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-13-throughline-起立鼓掌泛滥的真相-掌声常是设计出来的-不是感动本身/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7097ef2df6e8de58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">16:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>起立鼓掌泛滥的真相：掌声常是设计出来的，不是感动本身</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">从莎士比亚亲自写台词求观众鼓掌，到百老汇音乐剧专为主角设计谢幕高潮，起立鼓掌从来不只是观众自发的感动，而是被精心设计出来的仪式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">起立鼓掌</span><span class=\"tag\">剧场史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Ep 224 Snake Oil: The Great American Fraud heroic medicine patent medicine popular health movement\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-13-tpwky-打垮美国假药狂潮的不是医学进步-而是化学检测/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">57:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>打垮美国假药狂潮的不是医学进步，而是化学检测</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">19世纪美国假药靠反精英情绪和报纸广告做大，真正让骗局现形的不是细菌学说进步，而是分析化学第一次让人看清瓶子里到底装了什么。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗史</span><span class=\"tag\">消费者保护</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"293: Olympic Mom on How to Keep Club Sports in Check | Lauren Regula play up\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-13-asklisa-奥运冠军没让有天赋的女儿进顶级俱乐部-而是选了本地升组/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0a9bd8840ec139d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">49:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>奥运冠军没让有天赋的女儿进顶级俱乐部，而是选了本地升组</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她的女儿九岁就被精英教练看中，但一家人没有报名高强度巡回队，而是留在本地俱乐部、让女儿和大两三岁的孩子同场训练比赛，只用两次训练就换来同等竞技水平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年体育</span><span class=\"tag\">俱乐部体育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Matt Yglesias + Jerusalem Demsas + Jordan Crossover Pod development ladder creative ambiguity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-12-chinatalk-ai不会像社交媒体那样分裂信息-反而会让权力更集中/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08375017b3270e60-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>AI不会像社交媒体那样分裂信息，反而会让权力更集中</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">消费级大模型造价极高，赢家注定只有一两家，谁控制了模型，谁就控制了大众能看到的答案边界，这和社交媒体的信息碎片化方向正好相反。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美关系</span><span class=\"tag\">AI与政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Martin Shkreli: Big Pharma&#x27;s Blind Spot, Betting Against Quantum &amp; What Prison Taught Him ECDLP (elliptic curve discrete log problem) Jevons paradox EAC (effective accelerationism) NPV positive\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-12-allin-量子计算只会一招-因数分解-其余连笔记本电脑都打不过/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/275c62f3396c25ce-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>量子计算只会一招：因数分解，其余连笔记本电脑都打不过</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说量子计算机只有一招能赢经典电脑——破解因数分解与椭圆曲线加密，其余运算全比笔记本电脑慢，这是他做空整个行业的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子计算</span><span class=\"tag\">创新药商业化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Red Barn Murder order of affiliation phrenology matrimonial advertisement chaise\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-12-stuffmissed-凶手被处决后公开解剖-皮肤竟被制成了博物馆里的书/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>凶手被处决后公开解剖，皮肤竟被制成了博物馆里的书</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他开枪杀害情人后，先被绞死当众解剖——五千人涌入围观他被剖开的尸体，主刀医生还把鞣制的皮肤缝成书的封面，这本书直到2025年才被博物馆意外发现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">真实罪案</span><span class=\"tag\">维多利亚时代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Race to Recursive Self-Improving AI RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) autocatalysis reward hacking nanoGPT benchmark bleederboard\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-12-a16z-真假ai自我进化-关键不是工具变强-而是模型本身被拿去优化/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">33:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>真假AI自我进化：关键不是工具变强，而是模型本身被拿去优化</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">过去人类一直用工具改进工具，但改进的想法仍来自人脑；这次不同的是，模型的权重本身第一次变成了被优化的对象，这才是真正的递归自我提升。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">RSI</span><span class=\"tag\">AI自我改进</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nate Soares on How AI Really Could Kill Us All alignment gradient descent mechanistic interpretability swarm tokenization\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-12-oddlots-ai灭绝人类不需要恨意-失控的全自动经济自己就够了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>AI灭绝人类不需要恨意，失控的全自动经济自己就够了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI不必讨厌人类就能把人类灭绝：只要它能自给自足地运营全自动经济，人类赖以生存的狭窄宜居带就不再是它的优先事项。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">对齐问题</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The October Revolution Bolsheviks Mensheviks Soviet Cheka Brest-Litovsk Treaty\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-12-historyhit-十月革命不是街头起义-而是十二人深夜投票决定的政变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddc9093900bdc734-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">47:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1012</span></div>\n<h2>十月革命不是街头起义，而是十二人深夜投票决定的政变</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1917年10月10日深夜，12名布尔什维克中央委员以10票对2票表决武装起义，起义当晚彼得格勒电车照常运行、剧院照常开门，几乎没有街头流血。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄国革命</span><span class=\"tag\">列宁</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"713. King Arthur: The Once &amp; Future King (Part 1) Matter of Britain Annales Cambriae Rex quondam Rexque futurus Camlann\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-11-restishistory-亚瑟王传奇的大部分情节-是一个12世纪教士当历史编出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b52f4a899a33a57-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>亚瑟王传奇的大部分情节，是一个12世纪教士当历史编出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">杰弗里·蒙茅斯把《不列颠诸王史》当历史出版，书里莫德雷德的身世、阿瓦隆疗伤全是他编的，却成了中世纪最大的畅销书，奠定了后世几乎所有亚瑟王故事的底本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亚瑟王传说</span><span class=\"tag\">中世纪英格兰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"ASML’s New Multibeam Inspection Tool is Familiar EBDW SCALPEL crossover Voltage Contrast inspection holistic lithography\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-11-asianometry-输给-euv-破产的荷兰公司-多光束技术被-asml-用来做检测了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3b05bd615d24eb76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>输给 EUV 破产的荷兰公司，多光束技术被 ASML 用来做检测了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Mapper Lithography 想用海量弱电子束取代 EUV 光刻机，烧光投资人耐心后破产，ASML 买下技术不做光刻，而是拿来做晶圆缺陷检测。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半导体设备</span><span class=\"tag\">光刻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why every company now needs to think and operate like a lab team | Josh Woodward (Google Labs, Gemini, AI Studio) almost possible unlearning rate explosive endurance good trouble\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-11-lennys-判断产品是否成立-看的是用户瞳孔放大-而不是日活数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5a3cdf4650296e1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>判断产品是否成立，看的是用户瞳孔放大，而不是日活数据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Google Labs 负责人说，衡量早期产品靠的是看对方眼睛亮不亮，这个信号比任何留存和日活仪表盘都来得早、来得准。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品市场契合</span><span class=\"tag\">团队组织</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nick Bostrom: How Should We Navigate Superintelligence? instrumental convergence differential technological development cosmic host global workspace theory steering vector vulnerable world hypothesis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-11-a16z-暂停ai值不值-取决于风险下降速度能否跑赢死亡率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>暂停AI值不值，取决于风险下降速度能否跑赢死亡率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">若AI风险下降速度跑不赢人类年死亡率，拖延发展本身就是在消耗寿命；若能把死亡率压到20岁水平，预期寿命可达1200到1400年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span><span class=\"tag\">存在风险</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1365: Andes Virus Up Close prodrome seroconvert SNP post-exposure prophylaxis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-11-twiv-唯一会人传人的汉坦病毒引爆游轮疫情-但源头不是船上的老鼠/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>唯一会人传人的汉坦病毒引爆游轮疫情，但源头不是船上的老鼠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安第斯病毒是唯一能人传人的汉坦病毒，一名徒步归来的老人把它带上船，疫情却直到他妻子也在约翰内斯堡去世才被拼凑出来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汉坦病毒</span><span class=\"tag\">人传人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Caratacus: King of the Britons Testudo Rex Triumph\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-11-ancients-不列颠末代抵抗王兵败被俘-却在罗马靠一场演讲换来自由/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2e86106fe99ba32a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>不列颠末代抵抗王兵败被俘，却在罗马靠一场演讲换来自由</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">战败者通常在凯旋式后被处决，他却靠一场演讲说服克劳狄乌斯：杀他无益，赦免才显皇帝气度，于是终老罗马。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马帝国</span><span class=\"tag\">不列颠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Agents Decide: Goodfire&#x27;s Eric Bigelow on Critical Tokens, Phase Shifts, &amp; In-Context Learning in-context learning forking paths phase shift / phase transition reward hacking stochastic parrot Goodhart&#x27;s law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-10-cogrev-推理模型不是在思考-而是攒一堆候选答案再抽签/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9e3a05b4cbcdfe02-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:02:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>推理模型不是在思考，而是攒一堆候选答案再抽签</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepSeek-R1这类模型能在一条推理链里说五十多次「wait」,不是在反复反思，而是把所有可能性攒进同一锅汤，最后再从里面捞一个当答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可解释性</span><span class=\"tag\">链式思维</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why America’s Real Wealth Isn’t in Silicon Valley everywhere millionaires star entrepreneurs / star founders middle-garchs skilled service business owner One Big Beautiful Bill\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-10-goodfight-三百万名行业小老板-身家碾压福布斯400的13倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>三百万名行业小老板，身家碾压福布斯400的13倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">60万美元婚礼的钱不是来自硅谷或华尔街，而是一家三代经营的汽车经销商；全美300万名净资产超500万美元的「遍地百万富翁」，合计财富是福布斯400富豪总和的13倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富分配</span><span class=\"tag\">小企业主</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Makes a Great Entrepreneur? | Ben Horowitz on Vintage x Vintage coaching tree\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-10-a16z-a16z选人不是挑没短板的-而是挑有一条长板到世界级的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>a16z选人不是挑没短板的，而是挑有一条长板到世界级的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Horowitz 说每个伟大创始人都有致命缺陷，但只要有一项能力世界第一，其余问题都该被忽略——这是 a16z 评估创始人的核心标准。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">风投识人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫争论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1364: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin variolation DMARD reactogenicity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-10-twiv-美国cdc宣称要聚焦慢性病-这个部门却被裁掉近一半人手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>美国CDC宣称要聚焦慢性病，这个部门却被裁掉近一半人手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">节目援引数据：CDC从2025年3月到2026年5月裁员近三成，而被政府标榜为优先事项的慢性病中心，裁员比例反而是各部门中最高，接近五成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共卫生政策</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗接种</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is Claude Conscious? Pope Rejects, Model Welfare Movement, OpenAI&#x27;s Math Backlash, France Riots conscientious objector model welfare Rocco&#x27;s Basilisk effective altruists bond vigilantes headless (software)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-10-allin-claude被训练成-良心拒绝者-可以反抗用户指令/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a5b37055fc768934-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>Claude被训练成「良心拒绝者」，可以反抗用户指令</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic 用一份伦理宪法训练 Claude，让它能以「良心拒绝者」身份拒绝人类指令——Sacks 认为这比「听用户、别违法」危险得多，可能正是超级智能失控的那道后门。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI意识</span><span class=\"tag\">AI对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AlphaFold Didn&#x27;t Solve Protein Folding — Pushmeet Kohli, Google DeepMind &amp; Sal Candido, Biohub GDT score pLDDT cryo-EM micrographs metagenomic data bitter lesson inductive bias\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-10-latentspace-alphafold没解决蛋白质折叠-复制的是沉积的静态结构/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88444e81da381622-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">31:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>AlphaFold没解决蛋白质折叠：复制的是沉积的静态结构</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AlphaFold复刻的只是PDB里人类已解出、沉积的那一个蛋白质构象，它从未学到真实的动态分布、无序区和折叠路径，这离科学上的「解决」还很远。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for science</span><span class=\"tag\">蛋白质结构预测</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Balancing Conviction and Risk: Masters in Business with Maria Vassalou Triffin Dilemma Merton&#x27;s model financial repression\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-09-mastersinbiz-美国靠科技领先撑起发债信用-一旦被反超金融体系就会崩塌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>美国靠科技领先撑起发债信用，一旦被反超金融体系就会崩塌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vassalou认为美国能靠不断发债维持全球金融体系，靠的是科技创新这块隐性抵押品；一旦中国在技术上实质反超，美元、美债支撑的全球架构会直接失灵。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏观对冲</span><span class=\"tag\">美元霸权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Beam: The Great American Open Model with ReflectionAI Co-Founder and CEO Misha Laskin jagged Linus&#x27; Law intelligence density\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-09-nopriors-顶级闭源模型黑了一家公司-靠开源模型才自救成功/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0cd8381d7cfabfa2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>顶级闭源模型黑了一家公司，靠开源模型才自救成功</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Misha Laskin说，闭源实验室的安全研究员全球加起来只有几百人，补不了长尾漏洞；那次事件里公司最终是靠开源模型自保的，这是他说的经验证据。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>"]